&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HubSpot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HubSpot (NYSE: HUBS) is an AI-powered customer platform with all the software, integrations, and resources customers need to connect marketing, sales, and service. HubSpot&#39;s connected platform enables businesses to grow faster by focusing on what matters most: customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At HubSpot, bold is our baseline. Our employees around the globe move fast, stay customer-obsessed, and win together. Our culture is grounded in four commitments: Solve for the Customer, Be Bold, Learn Fast, Align, Adapt &amp;amp; Go!, and Deliver with HEART. These commitments shape how we work, lead, and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building a company&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers/hybrid-work&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; where people can do their best work&lt;/a&gt;. We focus on brilliant work, not badge swipes. By combining clarity, ownership, and trust, we create space for big thinking and meaningful progress. And we know that when our employees grow, our customers do too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized globally for our award-winning culture by Comparably, Glassdoor, Fortune, and more, HubSpot is headquartered in Cambridge, MA, with employees and offices around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore more:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;HubSpot Careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/lifeathubspot&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Life at HubSpot on Instagram&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;HubSpot may use AI to help screen or assess candidates, but all hiring decisions are always human. More information can be found &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hubspot.com/careers/hiring-ai&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. By submitting your application, you agree that HubSpot may collect your personal data for recruiting, global organization planning, and related purposes. We may use CLEAR ID Verification during the hiring process to confirm your identity and help maintain a safe, secure, and trusted experience for all candidates. Refer to HubSpot&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://legal.hubspot.com/recruiting-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruiting Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for details on data processing and your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The world of digital assets is accelerating in speed, magnitude, and complexity, opening the door to new ways for leveraging the blockchain. Fireblocks’ platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets and it trusted by some of the largest financial institutions, banks, globally-recognized brands, and Web3 companies in the world, including BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Revolut, and thousands more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Architect, EMEA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Fireblocks, the industry-leading digital asset infrastructure technology company responsible for 15% of all crypto transactions!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s the bit about us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fireblocks is an enterprise-grade platform for securely moving, storing, and issuing digital assets, powered by the Fireblocks Network and MPC-based wallet infrastructure. As of January 2026 we serve over 2,400 institutional customers, have secured over $10 trillion in digital asset transfers, and are the world’s highest-valued digital asset infrastructure company, with over $1 billion raised.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is simple: enable every business to easily and securely support digital assets &amp;amp; cryptocurrencies. Come join us as we &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Secure. Simplify. Scale&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s the bit about the opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Solution Architect in our EMEA Professional Services team, you own the technical delivery of Fireblocks implementations for the region’s largest Banks and Financial Institutions. From deal close through to production, you lead architecture design, integration, and deployment on customer infrastructure. You also bring that delivery expertise into strategic pre-sales cycles, helping Sales win the deals you will go on to deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the transition from deal close to production, taking end-to-end accountability for the solutions delivered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining enterprise customers’ setup with Fireblocks, including API integrations, security architecture, and architecture documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steering complex integrations across core banking, custody, tokenisation, and Travel Rule through to production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Codifying reusable reference architectures, integration patterns, and playbooks to scale delivery across EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as the bridge between Sales, Product, R&amp;amp;D, and customers to solve complex integration challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting strategic pre-sales cycles with technical discovery and solution design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring operational excellence and a high standard of customer satisfaction throughout delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or above in Computer Science or a related field, with 5+ years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering post-sale implementations in complex enterprise or financial services environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with either blockchain, cryptography, or Web3 technologies, or with Banks, Financial Institutions, or enterprise financial systems. One is a must, both is a strong advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software development experience and a hands-on technical mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of IT security and proven cloud experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of enterprise architecture and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated technical leadership, mentoring engineers or architects and setting technical standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre-sales exposure (solution architecture, sales engineering, or RFP support) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English; additional EMEA languages are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Please see our candidate privacy policy here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The world of digital assets is accelerating in speed, magnitude, and complexity, opening the door to new ways for leveraging the blockchain. Fireblocks’ platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets and it trusted by some of the largest financial institutions, banks, globally-recognized brands, and Web3 companies in the world, including BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Revolut, and thousands more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fireblocks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;, the industry-leading digital asset infrastructure technology company responsible for 15% of all crypto transactions!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s the bit about us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fireblocks is an enterprise-grade platform delivering a secure infrastructure for moving, storing, and issuing digital assets &amp;amp; cryptocurrencies. At Fireblocks, we enable businesses to securely build, run and scale digital asset operations through the Fireblocks Network and MPC-based Wallet Infrastructure. Our next-generation multi-layer technology protects Digital assets from cyber-attacks, internal collusion, and human error. Fireblocks is the only platform that provides insurance for digital assets in storage, transfer, and E&amp;amp;O.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As of January 2026, we serve over 2400 institutional customers, have secured the transfer of over $10 trillion in digital assets, and are the world&#39;s highest-valued digital asset infrastructure company, with over $1 billion raised.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is simple: Enable every business to easily and securely support digital assets &amp;amp; cryptocurrencies. Come join us as we&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Secure. Simplify. Scale&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s the bit about the opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This team focuses on expanding Fireblocks’ footprint across banks and large regulated financial institutions throughout the EMEA region. This is an individual contributor role responsible for driving enterprise-level sales in the UK for one of Fireblocks’ most strategic verticals. You’ll work closely with internal teams across Sales Engineering, Business Development, Product, and Marketing to deliver innovative digital asset solutions to traditional financial institutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve and exceed monthly and quarterly revenue targets within your region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive new business with Tier 1 and Tier 2 banks and expand existing relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the end-to-end sales process — from prospecting to negotiation and closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with key stakeholders, including C-suite, risk, compliance, and innovation teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the BDR, GTM, and Product teams to develop and execute effective go-to-market strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurately update and maintain customer information in Fireblocks’ CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to ensure seamless delivery and account coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise sales experience in financial services, fintech, or institutional software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success selling to banks, custodians, or large regulated financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of banking procurement processes, including RFPs, compliance, and multi-stakeholder decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to or a strong interest in digital assets, tokenisation, and blockchain technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate complex sales cycles and build strategic, long-term client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial and self-driven mindset with the ability to work autonomously in a fast-paced, matrixed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, with the ability to translate technical value into business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a comprehensive onboarding and training program for all new employees. We are looking for those who want to work with some of the industry&#39;s most talented contributors. You should bring a track record of success and experience closing complex deals within the financial services or fintech sector.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
