&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Supervise, coordinate, and mentor staff, including engineers and interns; support training and professional development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
