&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collection, checking and filing of all daily production &amp;amp; QA check sheets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Conduct daily label checks to ensure traceability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Calibration of weighing scales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Carry out temperature and quality checks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
