&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Commercial Analytics Manager to join our ambitious and fast-growing Commercial Finance team in London - this is a unique role where commercial analytics meets technical know-how, with the opportunity to directly influence the whole business model! In this exciting role you will be supporting with setting the analytical direction for the team, building &amp;amp; maintaining our BI infrastructure, and driving key analytical projects. Within this you will be looking to improve data quality &amp;amp; tooling across teams, bringing our analytical capabilities to the next level. This will form the foundation from which you will produce insightful and actionable dashboards, datasets &amp;amp; analysis, which in turn will be used to underpin key decisions and recommendations, informing future developments and improvement of our product (the meal kits we send our customers every week!) &amp;amp; operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In this hands on role you will be leading on the scoping, building and managing of our Commercial BI infrastructure, ensuring we are providing highly insightful and actionable analysis that leads to positive change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your technical skillset to identify, develop and implement new approaches and processes across the finance team, leveraging automation and AI tooling to simplify/optimise recurring processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideating, scoping and leading key strategic analytical projects focused on driving improvements in our core product &amp;amp; further P&amp;amp;L profitability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep diving large, complex datasets from across the business in order to pull out key insights which will influence real-time decision-making&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focused on improving our data quality &amp;amp; tooling across both finance and other teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Championing a strong data culture across the business, validating and influencing how teams adopt and act on analytical insights that directly drive the bottom line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present and obtain approval on any recommendations from Senior Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with non-finance teams from across the business such as Culinary, Menu Planning, Analytics, Procurement, Operations and Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with International HelloFresh geographies ensuring synergies are found and leveraged&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upskilling those around you to improve their technical skills, improve self service of information and help implement best practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who is naturally curious &amp;amp; a self-starter with the drive to make a change!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will have a broad remit across the whole P&amp;amp;L, so we want to meet people who can leverage their technical skillset to source data and scale existing processes and combine it with commercial acumen to then analyse and present the findings whilst steering the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SQL is essential; experience with Python a big plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Very strong Microsoft Excel/Google Sheets skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, including the ability to summarise quantitative concepts into a digestible format that is easy to understand and communicate to all levels of the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong working knowledge of data visualisation (Tableau preferred but not essential)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience in a high performance and culture environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage priorities simultaneously and meet time-sensitive deadlines in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead interactions with senior stakeholders and to summarise quantitative concepts into a digestible format&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management competencies - identify, design and implement change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoys working cross-functionally, across teams and departments to achieve a joint objective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll need to have a genuine interest in using data - something we love at HelloFresh! As well as an ability to use the data and information gathered to solve real business challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll have strong analytical abilities, and a keen interest to make a big impact on a fast-growing organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Dog friendly office!&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;● Nursery support scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: The HelloFresh Farm, 60 Worship Street, EC2A 2EZ, London&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Hybrid Working Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a hybrid working policy for eligible roles, allowing flexibility to work from home and in the office. For more details on eligibility and how this applies to the role you&#39;re applying for, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in the UK, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&amp;nbsp;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process Disclosure and Barring Service (&lt;span class=&quot;il&quot;&gt;DBS&lt;/span&gt;) checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
